# Executive Summary: Q1 2026 Call Forecast and Staffing

**For:** Director of Customer Care (simulated regional home-internet provider)
**Data:** synthetic, generated by `src/generate_data.py` (seed 42). All figures describe a simulated contact center.

## Decisions requested

1. **Hire {hires} agents now.** The roster of {roster} FTE falls short in {gap_weeks} of {full_weeks} weeks in Q1. Training takes 6 weeks, so new agents are productive from {ready} at the earliest.
2. **Approve {ot_scen} of overtime for Q1** to cover the gap until the new hires are ready. This includes {ot_notice} for the February 2 price-change notice.

